WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.320
I'm Kurata Sana, Grade One student
of junior high school.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.780
My manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:41.950
My Aoki award winning mama,
and the squirrel is Maro-chan.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.950
The best friend I met in the
bathroom, Fuka.

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:47.830
The amazing white bat, Babbit.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.040
I have something to say today.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.710
The one I hugh out with in
New York, Naozumi-kun.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.880
We have a close relationship now.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.930
Hayama Akito, my good friend...
I think.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.760
He's going out with Fuka now.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.520
Listen, Naozumi, think back
carefully now.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.440
Before meeting Sana-chan, didn't
you stand more in the spotlight?

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.650
Is it okay to let Sana-chan stand
in the spotlight all the time?

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.740
Everything is going well!

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.910
Is it okay to let Sana-chan stand
in the spotlight all the time?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:26.580
Dialogue That
Cannot Be Spoken

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.330
Then let's start.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.630
I'm sure everyone's
heard the rumors.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:36.340
The two young actors who have shined on New York's Broadway

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:40.970
and have just returned to the country will play a love story taking place in school.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:41.970
Yes!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.760
I've just come from America and my
Japanese is still quite bad.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.600
But I'll try my best.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:50.400
Being able to work with Sana-chan
again is an honor.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.060
Same here! Same here!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:02.780
And ever since I was little I've
always been a fan of the author.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:07.040
Being able to perform in one of
his works is a dream come true.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.040
Say something.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.790
What is this thing?
How can bugs talk?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.470
I am the screenwriter.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.340
What's so scary?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.430
Babbit is not a bug!

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.140
Are you the screenwriter?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.310
You haven't
finished your script yet!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:30.140
What a headache, I wanted to memorize the script ahead of time...

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.810
...so please finish it as soon as possible.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:35.730
I'll try my best.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.900
Sana-chan, how can you say
something like that to the screenwriter?

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:44.820
Don't be scared!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.610
Bugs looks like this.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.910
Maybe without the glasses and the
nose though.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.290
For the two actors please,

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:50.830
the script is about two lovers, is
it embarrassing for you two?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.250
No! Of course not!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:59.090
Because we can act according to
our true feelings. Right, Naozumi-kun?

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:02.800
I feel that private and
professional life shouldn't mix.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:10.430
In the world, even if you're friends, lovers or families, everyone's competing.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:14.770
Sana-chan is my priority, but she
will always be my rival.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.320
I will try my best and
not lose to her.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:23.360
Naozumi-kun says it well.
I'm liking you even more!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.950
Our team is composed
of the best people.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:29.330
Please rest assured, and look forward to the premiere.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.750
Let me butt in here, and field
some questions from the audience.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.790
Please listen to Babbit's English
Version of this song.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.800
One, two, one, two three, five!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.710
