please tell me.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.600
You always give me a scare,
Sana-chan.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.560
Really?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.810
Sana-chan, you did great,
really great.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:05:00.320
