something to tell me if you called me.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.800
No problem! I only wanted to
listen to your voice anyway.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.840
At least you've cheered up.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.380
Cheer up more, ok?

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.800
I know. Thank you.
Thank you very much.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.260
Just a note. Please, no phone
calls at three in the morning.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.190
Fuka-chan...

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.980
