00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.440
Good morning.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.190
Nice to meet you.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.520
Good morning, Sana-chan.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.320
Hi, Naozumi-kun.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.440
How early!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.900
This look is so nice.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:52.320
Really? Haven't dressed like this
in a while... feel a little strange...

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:56.500
Next time, can I try it on?
Please please.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.500
What? You want to wear that?

00:14:58.500 --> 00:14:59.460
Why not?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.250
This week's picture of Sana-chan
and Riho-chan.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.210
Her chest is gonna pop out.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.340
It's a desk. I missed it.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:11.090
Why don't you be honest with
yourself?

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:18.350
Sana-chan, oh no, Naozumi-kun has already memorized everything.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.940
Really? Naozumi-kun's words are
from the script?

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.310
We've just received the script.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.360
Naozumi-kun really has a good memory.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.570
Sana-chan, you just received
the script?

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.820
I got mine in the middle of last night.
Riho-san delivered it to me.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.370
So I could prepare it.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.910
Yesterday?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.330
I heard that the script was
finished yesterday.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.460
That's why Riho-san went to get it.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.130
I thought Sana-chan had already
received it.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.790
I didn't know.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.050
Rei-kun...
manager disqualification.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.800
That person...

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.140
Hooray for Riho-chan.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:56.010
Time to make some ear wax soup for
Rei-kun to eat.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.180
How do you cook earwax?

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:00.850
The correct term is cook some
fingernail dirt.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.020
But who'd want to drink that?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.440
Rei-kun, what's wrong with you?

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.690
Sana-chan.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.070
Today's shooting is open
to the public,

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.990
so they won't film too much.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.360
But a lot of important
TV people will be here.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:13.990
So?

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.870
This film's main
character is Sana-chan.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.370
- And Naozumi-kun.
- Technically, yes.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:21.410
But you must use your main
character mentality to act the best in you.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.210
Bring out the best in me?

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.830
Speaking with a little more force
is better, isn't it?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.880
I see.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.380
- Your competitor is also very serious.
- Competitor?

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.130
From now on,
memorize your script.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.380
I'll first say hi to
the screenwriter and others.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.180
Fine.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.300
How are you? Thank you for all
you've done for us.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.010
That's really called kissing butt.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.310
That is...
the script for scene two...

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.900
"So what are you planning to do?"

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.400
"You are..."

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:51.570
"You are a devil... till you are
dead, you'll always be the devil."

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:55.110
That's my line?

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.830
Akito-kun...

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.830
Hey, Akito-kun, are you going to
karate today?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.160
Yeah, but only to practice.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.460
After that,
do you want to hang out?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.130
It's not often that we can do that
after school. Come on, OK?

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.420
Fuka-chan said it's OK with her.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:22.310
It's ok. After practice, you'll be
tired. Don't push yourself.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.770
Doesn't matter, I'll go.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.150
That's it. It's only gonna be
a little while.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.770
This is great, isn't it,
Fuka-chan?

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.730
I'm getting embarrassed.

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.950
It'll be better if you are more
honest with yourself...

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.990
That's none of your business.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.540
OK.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.910
That does it.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.870
The sixth scene is next.
Sorry to trouble you.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:46.870
Yes.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.210
Shinji, don't relax,
this isn't practice.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.500
I know.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.340
Sana-chan, this scene with Shinji
is all yours.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.260
Yes...

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.920
Naozumi-kun, be on stand-by, ok?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.130
OK.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.640
Starting the sixth scene.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.260
Ready... Action.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.060
He's here.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.520
You're quick.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.190
You ran here?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.440
Yeah.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:11.820
Let's go.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.160
This, this... this is really stiff.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.000
It's a sticker picture machine.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.710
Wanna take one, Aya-chan?

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.550
It looks like fun.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.010
Akito...

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:36.840
Yeah, yeah.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.970
You just don't understand me!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.600
Dev... dev...

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.850
Cut.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.810
What is it, Sana-chan?
Did you forget your line?

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.940
You're a devil.
You'll always be a devil.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.020
OK?

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:55.110
Sorry, I'll remember now.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.150
Let's try again.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.950
Ready, start.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.280
I can't take this. Wordy!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.030
You just don't understand me!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.620
You're a dev...

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.170
Sana-chan...

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.580
What should I do?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.090
You're a devil.
You're a devil's child.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.720
Hayama is a devil,
go back to hell!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.510
I can't say something like that.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.550
Sorry.

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:27.100
It's hard to say that line.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.850
Can we change that a little?

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.600
We can say octopus head! Or ghost!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.770
Ghost.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.820
What are you saying, Sana-chan?

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.030
You are dissatisfied with my work?

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:42.610
No... not that. It's just that if it's possible can we change the line?

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.330
How can you say something like
that to him?

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.410
I'm sorry, may I borrow her for
a second?

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.960
Sana-chan, come here.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:53.210
An actress who has just come back
from New York is not easy to work with.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.710
Naozumi-kun, water.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.630
Thank you.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.970
Too bad.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.850
Fuka, do you have two hundred yen?
I'll pay you back.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:12.940
OK.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.770
What? Hold on for a second.
I'll break the change.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.860
Why do I still get nervous
whenever I'm with him alone?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.160
Why?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.910
Hey, if you're not playing,
step aside.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.580
I said, get out of my way.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.450
I'll play first.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.500
Sorry to make you wait so long.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.330
Are you giving me money?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.500
Akito...

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.550
Fuka, I'm here.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.670
Damn... shut the hell up.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.010
What are you doing?

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.090
Gimme the money.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.260
You want to borrow the money?

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.760
I said shut the hell up.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.100
Akito-kun.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:51.390
Brat.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:53.640
Akito.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.610
- Fuka-chan!
- What are you guys doing?

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.740
Oh, no.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.740
Fuka-chan?

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.910
Akito-kun.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.990
Escape!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.580
You scared me to death.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.410
What were you doing, Akito-kun?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:12.620
I don't know myself.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.660
It's better that we go now.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.080
Fuka-chan?

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:19.460
It hurts.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:21.420
Fuka, what's wrong?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.470
Akito, my eyes hurt a lot.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.890
It hurts!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.510
Akito-kun?

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:43.650
We moved open shooting
one day early...

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:46.400
...maybe Sana-chan just wasn't ready.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:50.330
The sixth scene starts tomorrow,
try your best.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.080
OK.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.240
See you.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:56.080
- I'm sorry.
- We'll try our best tomorrow.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.830
Tomorrow, we'll try our best.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:02.880
Hi... hello?

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.340
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:07.090
Sana-chan is working right now...

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:09.180
Something very important?

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:16.770
You're the mother?

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:18.520
Please, this way.

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:27.030
Tsuyoshi-kun, how is Fuka?
What about Hayama?

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:40.080
matte  mou wakaretai no yo

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:40.080
"Wait... I want us to split up", I said

